This folder contains completely synthetic datasets, including Orders, Products, Customers, Order Details, and Date Dimensions. These datasets have been generated solely for educational, training, and learning purposes and do not represent any real individuals, organizations, or transactions.

Any unauthorized use, distribution, modification, misrepresentation, or misuse of these datasets is strictly prohibited. The owner of the dataset reserves the right to take appropriate legal action against any individual or entity found to be misusing the data or violating these terms.
